PHP 8.6 removed the zval_dtor() alias of zval_ptr_dtor_nogc()
(UPGRADING.INTERNALS). This is upstream pull request
https://github.com/Imagick/imagick/pull/768 (open as of 2026-11-05); the
XtOffsetOf() removal is covered by the cherry-picked upstream commit
b580a705e2. Drop once the pull request is merged and released.

diff --git a/imagick.c b/imagick.c
index 68e63e13..fc9a4a52 100644
--- a/imagick.c
+++ b/imagick.c
@@ -704,7 +704,7 @@ static zval *php_imagick_read_property(zval *object, zval *member, int type, voi
 	}
 
 	if (member == &tmp_member) {
-		zval_dtor(member);
+		zval_ptr_dtor_nogc(member);
 	}
 
 	return retval;
@@ -778,7 +778,7 @@ static zval *php_imagick_read_property(zval *object, zval *member, int type, con
